  "oral_argument": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice Roberts",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2f8d9b98a34ac9ce48783cd2941e7b1e2bacfeb69be8055c0292a263b0c512fa",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2f8d9b98a34a-0000-0006"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Chief Justice Roberts, chief Justice Roberts introduced the argument: \u201cWe will hear argument next in Vaden v. Discover Bank.\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2f8d9b98a34ac9ce48783cd2941e7b1e2bacfeb69be8055c0292a263b0c512fa",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2f8d9b98a34a-0000-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 5,
              "start": 5
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Ginsburg asked: \u201cWhy isn\u2019t section\u202f2 of the Arbitration Act sufficient to take care of the ouster doctrine, whatever may have been left of it?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Souter",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2f8d9b98a34ac9ce48783cd2941e7b1e2bacfeb69be8055c0292a263b0c512fa",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2f8d9b98a34a-0000-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 7,
              "start": 7
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Souter, justice Souter questioned: \u201cWhat is it in the text of section\u202f2 that would seem to leave it inadequate to touch equity as well as law?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Stevens",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2f8d9b98a34ac9ce48783cd2941e7b1e2bacfeb69be8055c0292a263b0c512fa",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2f8d9b98a34a-0000-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 9,
              "start": 9
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Stevens asked: \u201cWhy do the words \u2018save for such agreement\u2019 cut back on the jurisdiction?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice KENNEDY",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2f8d9b98a34ac9ce48783cd2941e7b1e2bacfeb69be8055c0292a263b0c512fa",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2f8d9b98a34a-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 37,
              "start": 37
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kennedy asked: \u201cCould you have brought a declaratory judgment action to establish that your Federal claim\u2014?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2f8d9b98a34ac9ce48783cd2941e7b1e2bacfeb69be8055c0292a263b0c512fa",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2f8d9b98a34a-0002-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 44,
              "start": 44
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Scalia, justice Scalia expressed concern: \u201cThat\u2019s what worries me.\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2f8d9b98a34ac9ce48783cd2941e7b1e2bacfeb69be8055c0292a263b0c512fa",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2f8d9b98a34a-0003-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 57,
              "start": 57
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kennedy later asked: \u201cIs the petitioner\u2019s argument for a limited look\u2011through compromised by the Beneficial Bank case which allows removal if there is a Federal defense?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Stevens",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2f8d9b98a34ac9ce48783cd2941e7b1e2bacfeb69be8055c0292a263b0c512fa",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2f8d9b98a34a-0003-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 58,
              "start": 58
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Stevens questioned a definition: \u201cThat isn\u2019t quite true, because here there is a definition in the Federal claim.\u201d"
      }
    ],
